- var films = morii_cinema_catalog()
.cinema(data-cinema)
  .cinema-stage
    .cinema-screen
      video.cinema-video(data-cinema-video controls preload='none' playsinline hidden)
      iframe.cinema-embed(data-cinema-embed title='电影播放器' allow='autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture' allowfullscreen referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' sandbox='allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-presentation' hidden)
      .cinema-screen-placeholder(data-cinema-placeholder)
        .cinema-screen-topline
          span.cinema-screen-live(aria-hidden='true')
          span MORII CINEMA
          span SCREEN 01
        .cinema-screen-art(aria-hidden='true')
          span.cinema-screen-orbit
          span.cinema-screen-spark ✦
        .cinema-screen-message
          span.cinema-screen-eyebrow YOUR PRIVATE SCREENING ROOM
          strong 故事，从这里开始。
          p 选一部喜欢的作品，挑一集，按下播放。
        .cinema-screen-bottom
          span 放慢一点，认真看一场。
          span MOVIE / SERIES / ANIME
    .cinema-now
      .cinema-now-heading
        span.cinema-now-kicker
          span.cinema-now-kicker-dot(aria-hidden='true')
          |  当前放映
        span.cinema-now-type(data-cinema-type) 影厅待映
      .cinema-now-body
        span.cinema-now-label NOW SHOWING · 01
        h2(data-cinema-title aria-live='polite') 选择一部作品
        p(data-cinema-description) 从下方片单选片。电影、电视剧和动漫，都可以在这里慢慢看。
      .cinema-now-foot
        span.cinema-now-foot-icon(aria-hidden='true') ↗
        div
          strong 你的专属放映厅
          small 选择作品后，片源和选集将在这里出现。
  .cinema-library
    .cinema-library-heading
      div
        span.section-kicker THE COLLECTION
        h2 片单
      p #{films.length} 部作品 · 找个想看的故事
    if films.length
      .cinema-toolbar
        .cinema-filters(role='group' aria-label='作品分类')
          each category in [{key:'all', name:'全部'}, {key:'movie', name:'电影'}, {key:'series', name:'电视剧'}, {key:'anime', name:'动漫'}]
            button.cinema-filter(type='button' data-cinema-filter=category.key aria-pressed=category.key === 'all')= category.name
        label.cinema-search
          span.sr-only 搜索片名
          svg(viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linecap='round' aria-hidden='true')
            circle(cx='10.8' cy='10.8' r='6.8')
            path(d='m16 16 4.5 4.5')
          input(type='search' data-cinema-search placeholder='搜索片名' autocomplete='off')
      .cinema-grid(data-cinema-grid)
        each film, index in films
          article.cinema-card(data-cinema-card data-type=film.type data-title=film.title data-description=film.description)
            button.cinema-card-button(type='button' data-cinema-select aria-label='选择 ' + film.title aria-pressed='false')
              .cinema-poster
                if film.cover
                  img(src=url_for(film.cover) alt='' loading='lazy')
                else
                  span.cinema-poster-mark(aria-hidden='true')= film.type === 'series' ? '◇' : film.type === 'anime' ? '✧' : '✦'
                .cinema-poster-top
                  span= film.type === 'series' ? '剧集' : film.type === 'anime' ? '动漫' : '电影'
                  span= String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')
                span.cinema-poster-play(aria-hidden='true') ▶
                span.cinema-poster-bottom(aria-hidden='true') 点击选择 ↗
              .cinema-card-copy
                .cinema-card-meta
                  span= film.year || 'MORII CINEMA'
                  span= film.episodes.length ? film.episodes.length + (film.type === 'movie' ? ' 个片源' : ' 集') : '即将上架'
                strong= film.title
                p= film.description || '挑一段空闲时间，来这里看一场。'
                span.cinema-card-action 查看片源 #[span(aria-hidden='true') →]
            .cinema-card-data(hidden)
              each episode in film.episodes
                span(data-cinema-episode data-kind=episode.kind data-url=url_for(episode.url) data-title=episode.title)
      p.cinema-empty(data-cinema-no-results hidden) 没有找到符合条件的作品，试试别的关键词。
    else
      .cinema-empty.panel
        strong 放映表还空着
        p 在博客的 source/_data/cinema.yml 中添加作品与播放地址，就可以开始放映。
  p.cinema-note 片源由站点维护者提供。播放效果取决于视频格式、片源服务及浏览器支持。
